Subject: dock-surface: share overlay placement while preserving base layout

DockLayout anchors auxiliary dock content above a base or replaces it visually
without changing its layout size. Replacement content makes the base inert.
onOverhang reports how far the overlay reaches above the layout, so a caller
can reserve that band in the content the overlay covers.

